#: scenario6:scenario6_CA195F44_E69A_47A7_8596_4880D7E9C30E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 54df7e416465d81c802d809f3ff2ae64abb9b166f143da740c0409f257b65752
